window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In the final installment of the Tracking Trouble series, Arwen must confront her dark-elven kin once and for all while helping Azerdash win a war against all of dragon kind.</p> <p>Ambitious tasks under any circumstances. But, to make matters worse, Gemlytha, the powerful woman Azerdash has admitted having feelings for, isn’t as dead as everyone believed.</p> <p>When he comes face to face with her again, will he choose Arwen? Or Gemlytha?</p>"; 
